From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WebCore: adapt the engine above the platform layer to iOS 6

Style, DOM, CSS, rendering, layout, page, bindings, loader and the rest:
WEBKIT_IOS6 guards around code that assumes a newer platform, the header that
defines createsGroupForStyle included rather than stubbed, and the quirks this
port has to answer for.
